Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.66,Hook,,0,0,0,,SOLO QUERÍA UNA MOTO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oh, mira esa moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Me puedo robar esa moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Claro que me la voy a\Nrobar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Te la vas a robar, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Espera, ¿me oyeron?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Mierda! ¿Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Metí la pata.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Te necesito, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡mierda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:20.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a matar a cualquiera\Nque se me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}atraviese.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Quieren problemas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:23.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Quieren problemas\Nconmigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Todo bien, muchachos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy por sus cosas, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:28.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Hazlo volar en pedazos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Mierda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Mierda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:34.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Me saqué un montón de\Ndinero con esto!
